  "description": "Azure OpenAI v1 adapter for Rystem.PlayFramework, powered by OpenAI 2.12.0. Supports Responses API, automatic file upload via Files API, and SHA256-based multi-level caching.",
  "iconFile": "rystem.png",
  "id": "Rystem.PlayFramework.Adapters",
